{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c161398094e8006818a6cdebe7b609725d6a125b9e12529e320fafa9c0d2b04e", "ja": "えっと、布の発注だけ最後にチェックを……\nあ、新作で風鈴の柄が出るんだ！　かわいい♪", "zh": "那个，最后只检查一下布料的订购……\n啊，新款里有风铃图案！好可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "9a923b941cc0d238f5aa9ce0b297418822af277777557e7f58074e1a7f323e71", "ja": "この柄なら浴衣かな～……そういえば余ってる布で\n色が合わせやすいのあったかも……。", "zh": "这个花纹的话，做成浴衣应该不错～……说起来，剩下的布里好像有容易搭配颜色的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "4876bb2588eb8221b0ac55d88bb6ae5792c8a1a4e50c0c7a5523c36c0cd77262", "ja": "そうなると帯が紺色で……うん、いけそう！\n赤は金魚、黄色は花火をモチーフにして……！", "zh": "这样一来腰带就用藏青色……嗯，应该没问题！\n红色以金鱼为主题，黄色以烟花为主题……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1003_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "622e0445c0717ce1da3632e5b024d56f2a73000c3302e3fb3f0ce7c7602ee805", "ja": "お疲れ様です青羽さん。お仕事に精が\n出ていますけど、今日は確か半休でしたよね？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。您工作干劲十足，不过我记得今天应该是上半天班吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ce70aa23367db1c1018313d52be51049a3fc1e714d348f20bdea0d94d3d38105", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}さん！？\nそう！　半休です！　そのはずなんですけど！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n对！今天是半休！本来应该是这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "93f59334788f08b483782fc74b6ee760f298a71ffdd1520c205e72f4516392e9", "ja": "私の頭と体が勝手に、\n衣装作りをしようとしてしまって……！", "zh": "我的脑袋和身体擅自就想做服装了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5994796018e05d6813f0e56a4ff84bb8c4efba90b18bfcd3ed0f8103a723fd29", "ja": "はは、仕事人間ですね。　\nでもその気持ち、少しわかる気がします。", "zh": "哈哈，真是个工作狂啊。\n不过这种心情，我好像也有点理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5ce0d5cafd4442f8f1a30a53da42d6b33a1df1d404cf13bed6c85b326fb59b2", "ja": "休日に街を歩いたりスマホを見ていても、\nプロデュースの事をつい考えてしまって。", "zh": "即使休息日上街散步或刷手机，也还是会不由得思考偶像制作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3084a962af43e83a638d9f10b11c282eb3c7eba6649f803dd707d24e8232618c", "ja": "アイドルプロデュースに関しては、\n休みなんて本当はないのかもしれません。", "zh": "说到偶像制作，或许其实根本没有休息日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "0107e9d6c3a45cce7eaa1a6af2d4d6a3c23701687ab6edee3c93c11c6be549c6", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\nそうなんですね……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是\n这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a334c4d18afee7a7fa619884b38182b7cf777178169259747bbaa99a0427a82a", "ja": "でも、休みは休みです。\nちゃんと休息は必要です。", "zh": "不过，休息就是休息。\n好好休息是很有必要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "b9771f23cc938d9364634b39e7ead460985737844ab47a86dd7cbdcc2e4c8119", "ja": "うう……そうですよね。", "zh": "呜呜……你说得对呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bf1782e14d12b445016a7bb871189ea989921cebbf61e3cb593fae5b73f5770e", "ja": "なので、どうしてもというなら\nアイディアだけ書き留めておいてはどうですか？", "zh": "所以，如果实在想做的话，先把点子记下来怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "56925ec10e52697cc0e78d9b436ecfd8c511921697b8d19e9a5c398f9a9c1872", "ja": "閃きは降りてくるものですし、\n逃さないよう書き留めておく必要がありますから。", "zh": "灵感会自己降临，而且还得把它记下来，免得错过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b1e96e0cfa8c300d8d54d9626223283334d859886b06f08dc44100b2f2681d07", "ja": "見直したり形にするのは休日明けに。\nそう割り切っておけばいいのかなと。", "zh": "整理和成形的工作等休息日结束后再做。\n这样划清界限就好了，我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "99edf5073b907715ffc467a2172707a326c3e8015c2a6f9532995f775bb6a819", "ja": "なるほど……。\nあくまでアイディアだけ……。", "zh": "原来如此……  \n也就是说，暂时只停留在想法上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "69f54d93e6c409d2a77769f2bbec29f94d27837c26f60e56e58adac93cdf3650", "ja": "はい。時に全力で、時に休んで、\nその繰り返しをやっていきましょう。", "zh": "是的，有时要全力以赴，有时也要休息，就这样不断重复下去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d28c81700353d664e4377ae55360b79082d4cc7d5840b1419b1498d2f0a46a90", "ja": "我々のアイドルを支える仕事に、\n終わりはありませんから！", "zh": "支撑偶像的工作，是没有尽头的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "3177f76be80d0640b0488e3e7b9179ce25482fa70561813a003e7da01147198c", "ja": "はい！\n本当に、その通りですね！", "zh": "是！\n确实，正如您所说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b1a31174674bede8db3aa819d436e54cd31aaf398b9e75788d9e6b79f04f1568", "ja": "自分は事務所で社長とのミーティングを\n済ませたら、すぐ戻ってきます。", "zh": "我在事务所和社长开完会后，就马上回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7e8af463183a5b87582e61ce9b25ad4a86bc133951e4f4d95cc03ffc158acb6d", "ja": "今日の仕事はそこまでですよ。\nあとは、しっかり休んでくださいね！", "zh": "今天的工作就到这里了。\n接下来请好好休息吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "be6a2d92c0548c88e79aa6251b2a87f7cf70c3c724558dcbcacf0be485052cd2", "ja": "わかりました！　いってらっしゃ～い！\n……アイディアだけ……。", "zh": "明白了！路上小心哦～！\n……只有点子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1023_102mis", "source_sha256": "4b5f54bcf5ef73e0da7b0672d6f66742978d5dc34da111169b25cf9171467afc", "ja": "浴衣の案だけここに記入しておいて……\n休日明けに、全力で取り掛かろうっと！", "zh": "先把浴衣的方案记在这里……\n等休息日结束后，再全力开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1024_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "787bd24a66a524c32fff3b6b31f62f0fd86ada3c9f864be9fdb21a7c5bdca5f4", "ja": "長かったBOTもつい先日最終戦を終え、\nいよいよエンディングを迎えることとなる。", "zh": "漫长的BOT也在前几天结束了最终战，终于要迎来结局了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "827ae552994401b0aa9cc124e895f547452a9dfe4286adc184d6b4d0ebc0a243", "ja": "属性を2つに分けて計6チームで競い合ってきた\nこのシリーズ……熱い戦いの日々でした……！", "zh": "按属性分成2组、总计6支队伍互相竞争的\n这个系列……真的是一段热战连连的日子啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "db979c8a9232c06b3b83b21bf8a61e7356d41d0eb29eb76efdc32d23fb678a27", "ja": "はい。企画の説明を聞いたとき、\nさすがは社長と思いました！", "zh": "是的。听到企划说明时，我就觉得不愧是社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a190810567bb7602581dab1db8bc03f548f19aee2bea73c8d0462c4fe7e2b159", "ja": "オープニングは開幕宣言の公演として\n大いに盛り上がりましたが、今回は……？", "zh": "开场公演作为宣布活动开幕的演出，气氛十分热烈，不过这次……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "bc08deac9f581dd63fe40e7863f38c0063bb18a869b45bb6d672587ec81a1293", "ja": "そこなんだが、エンディング公演の内容は\n君に任せようと思っている！", "zh": "不过，谢幕公演的内容，我想交给你来安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "aa6fefbaa78eb96c578e892c5c761ef612d3a57e7ed1945ea62756b1af516c9f", "ja": "えっ。いいんですか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "5adcbf15223b7df8f6b8937db2ab5d779ece473aec27e0f6532cd995ee694592", "ja": "うむ！　アイドルたちが火花を散らして\n駆け抜けてきたシリーズ、そのフィナーレだ。", "zh": "嗯！这是偶像们激烈交锋、一路奋勇闯过的系列最终篇章。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "41a02500ff49626199a54c22f3f41e09a8ffd7a19712dc59949e0a5f77612b21", "ja": "なら、一番近くで見守ってきた君が、プロデュース\nするのが当然だ。音無くん、君もそう思うだろう？", "zh": "那么，一直在最近的地方守望着她的你来负责制作，才是理所当然的。音无，你也这么认为吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "a42e79a41b8219474f9a4f41818ff041db00705fb3dd8d42526d1acca7b9fdf7", "ja": "そうですね。アイドルたちが真剣勝負に\n向き合ったり、集中できたのは……。", "zh": "是啊。偶像们能够认真面对这场较量、集中精神，也是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "e453b3053ff6dd9bbdd6e2201a075c77c2ad14c90ffba97da52800735156a6c5", "ja": "他ならぬ{$P$}さんの\nおかげだと思います。", "zh": "我想这都多亏了{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "04fa3e6fcdae0e15d74d544b0fd09d21660940eed3da8ca1f07d937cecb6ed6f", "ja": "本当に、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "真的辛苦您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
