{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0444_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "8f9424198ebc69324a7fb416711c58cc4da3967bd03d8f98e85a59bfe5f077e1", "ja": "今回の公演で、君の手で、\n彼女たちに勲章をかけてやってくれたまえ！", "zh": "在本次公演中，请亲手为她们挂上勋章吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
